{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_001_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6f629d0936a29b60bdb2e9ea3e3a6cc505d8049e2967021e1d8f17a919555582",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93475ece1f6bd93bb7972513be626d9502e63302545104083938b1dce92c17e1",
      "text": "辛苦啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3157a8cbc40c2607ba37af4ff20fb57538006d5305c6a3436741ef49a5c82ed2",
      "text": "收下这个吧，是白色情人节的礼物。\n情人节时送我巧克力，多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c276849eb3ad512d083a6fd421268076da48ef01742fc9b933151e53059f8dcf",
      "text": "虽然在送什么好上面超伤脑筋的，\n不过总算是挑到了能让自己满意的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baba20a8835070481ed38f73032648f7f9581ec7fcebb277a9aa18286370cacf",
      "text": "我想大概你也会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fd210c8cbe6ba09cc68598aa16a3c15e67f8580411d900a3133eac03b6b2dc1",
      "text": "里面的东西等回家后再看吧。\n那我先走啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64d3bf17e845697198766e7542e4239fcbbe27ce33192a55bc3e01aa878ef0a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n现在稍微方便聊会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9329b2ee8eb393b4b9fba1cb7cebd32101281e384e17175fa416f791d4ed9f8",
      "text": "看你平时总是那么忙，\n我觉得机会就只有趁现在了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9114326a671bfcd46de6bbf59633511a49efb5fdb31a746383585e64d13a14a6",
      "text": "情人节的回礼，先交给你吧。\n真的超级感谢你啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9473d528fd71685a2b109354e8c0d0aa0a9ef1d496c4058a9eb3c201e696541",
      "text": "那盒巧克力真的超级好吃。\n下次告诉我是在哪里买的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d905e10f2194529da92c9899ddddcde6ccfe6d5812a88b90a7afbe1775c54bb6",
      "text": "我也准备了回礼，想着应该能配得上\n制作人送的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ccd55b4ce3b4552f1ef0382327b8f85ab71dbb44850556420abf2587de61575",
      "text": "虽然不知道合不合你的口味，\n但要是你能喜欢的话我会很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000046:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000047:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:459dc2c67aae5dc36d5555641bb265b214779340442848cc697afe74712897f4",
      "text": "很期待拆开呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b3579274d78f040057077a5e7003b59cdb8c4064293c5a01a11885e914ab716",
      "text": "哦！\n……啊。拆封请留到我不在的地方再拆哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b3579274d78f040057077a5e7003b59cdb8c4064293c5a01a11885e914ab716",
      "text": "哦！\n……啊。拆封请留到我不在的地方再拆哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7d01e4ae7d16d63e7d7a14ad0b6a594cf419175ab7999de9601a4828c29bfdb",
      "text": "总觉得稍微有点不好意思嘛。\n就拜托你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_22:5_02_001_22_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b36561669116fbc16ec34c23dd8153f5d0b081c9b482fbcd8359389def02caf0",
      "text": "那么，今天的工作也拜托你啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
